              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jayahudi kadi Jayunani de mbe, jamiru kadi ng’atu ma jamiru ngo de mbe, nico kadi nyaku de mbe; kum kewu ceke wu ng’atu acel i Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
